{"id":"6a8560d21b03f127","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-large-cardinal.md","title":"Large Cardinal","display":"df-large-cardinal — Large Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-large-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-large-cardinal"],"display":"df-large-cardinal — Large Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-large-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-large-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-large-cardinal — Large Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak L\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak L\\in V\\)</span> (set of codes for designated large-cardinal properties)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\">\\(E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded evaluation relation on the cardinals under discussion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LargeCardinal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LargeCardinal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S(\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\in\\mathfrak L\\land E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\\land\\forall p\\in E_{\\mathfrak L}\\;\\exists\\Psi\\in\\mathfrak L\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(p=\\langle\\Psi,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S(\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\in\\mathfrak L\\land E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\\land\\forall p\\in E_{\\mathfrak L}\\;\\exists\\Psi\\in\\mathfrak L\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(p=\\langle\\Psi,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{LargeCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S(\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\land\\langle\\Phi,\\kappa\\rangle\\in E_{\\mathfrak L}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{LargeCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S(\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\land\\langle\\Phi,\\kappa\\rangle\\in E_{\\mathfrak L}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Property codes and their evaluation relation are sets. Pair-shape and cardinality are checked elementwise, so no Cartesian product with the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is treated as a set.</li>\n<li>Consistency or interpretability strength is metamathematical data and is not silently folded into the object-language predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LargeCardinal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S(\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\in\\mathfrak L\\land E_{\\mathfrak L}\\in V\\land\\forall p\\in E_{\\mathfrak L}\\;\\exists\\Psi\\in\\mathfrak L\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(p=\\langle\\Psi,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{LargeCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{LargeCardinalProperty}_S(\\Phi,\\mathfrak L,E_{\\mathfrak L})\\land\\langle\\Phi,\\kappa\\rangle\\in E_{\\mathfrak L}","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1689,"backlinks":[{"id":"180e55a5516174c6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"230ed0bcd9d8b46a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b7e91aa4c8d5d265","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3e8e27514727b12c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-760","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-large-cardinal.md|58-df-large-cardinal]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}